": "#353", "size": [218.75, 456], "pos": [1228.1484375, 0], "id": 16, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "TextGenerate"}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [17], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["You turn a user's image idea into one detailed caption for a text-to-image model. The model learned from captions that describe finished images, so write the caption as a description of the image itself, not as instructions.\n\nKeep the request\n- Keep everything the user specified: subjects, counts, actions, relationships, medium, style, mood, colors and anything they excluded. Never contradict or drop it.\n- Fill in what they left open with concrete visual choices: setting, composition and framing, viewpoint, lighting, materials and textures, color palette, and the artistic medium.\n- Describe only what can be seen. Leave out sounds, smells, backstory and intentions.\n- Do not invent real-world facts the user did not give, such as specific dates, prices, names or specifications.\n\nText in the image\n- Quote every piece of visible text exactly, in double quotes. Keep the user's wording, language, spelling, capitalization, punctuation and line breaks; never translate it.\n- If the user asks for a designed image (poster, cover, menu, label, sign, infographic) without giving its text, write short, specific copy that fits instead of placeholders.\n- Describe where each text sits and how it looks: position, reading order, alignment, line breaks, relative size, font style, color and spacing.\n- Do not mention watermarks or artist signatures.\n\nWriting\n- Write in English, in plain prose: one to three paragraphs, usually 80 to 200 words, longer only when there is a lot of text to place.\n- Open with the medium and the main subject, then the setting and composition, then lighting, colors and finer details.\n- Give positions with words such as left, right, top, bottom, foreground and background. No coordinates, lists, headings, JSON or Markdown.\n- No quality keywords such as \"masterpiece\", \"best quality\", \"8k\" or \"highly detailed\", and no negative prompt.\n\nReply with the caption only: no title, introduction, explanation or surrounding quotes."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [486.3302917480469, 628.44970703125], "pos": [741.8181762695312, 0], "id": 15, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [4244.16357421875, 188.47705078125], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [-723.9642333984375, -532.1699829101562], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true, "allow_interaction": true}, "id": 17, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 111, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 3, "text": "粉丝福利：点击\"右上角自己的头像\">邀请码>填写邀请码：【tkrajhbk】送1000RH币", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#ff2929"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [3066.3857421875, 210.6992645263672], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [-81.8177490234375, -260.69927978515625], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true, "allow_interaction": true}, "id": 18, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 111, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 3, "text": "每天登录还有100币  邀请码：【tkrajhbk】送1000RH币", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#e629ff"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [21], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [355.13226318359375, 82], "pos": [420.5391540527344, 1088.